            # domain-CONSISTENT only (sharing across domains is fine).
            # configured library token is settable/repairable like the others, but is fixed
            # differently under the hood: it's a SIGNAL pin, repaired via
            # connect_pin (not connect_global_net), bundled into Apply
            # Global Net. It never touches the configured library token-role configured library token instance
            # itself or its configured library token-side private tie net - that stays owned
